<title>USA: Quest Intl to buy back up to 5 pct shares.</title>
<headline>Quest Intl to buy back up to 5 pct shares.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nevada 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quest International Resources Corp said its plans to buy back up to five percent of its shares on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>&quot;Quest believes the shares to be significantly undervalued and having created a large cash position, view this as an opportunity to retire shares at low prices and further demonstrate fiscal and fiduciary responsibility,&quot; the board of directors said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
